      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The incidence, severity and potential disability of low back pain are related, in particular, to previous back complaints, heavy lifting and the general psychosocial environment and to the physical constitution of the individual, viz the endurance of his back muscles. Recommendations for approach to the problem in future are discussed."},
